Zig for Debian/Ubuntu
=====================

See <https://ziglang.org/documentation/master/> for the official documentation.

Use <https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues> for bug reports regarding Zig itself.

Use <https://github.com/javanile/zig-ppa/issues> for bug reports and
feature requests regarding the packaging of Zig for Debian/Ubuntu.
